      "method": "On u>0 compose the rational inverse with S1. For u<=0 use S2 to show the function vanishes on a neighborhood. Its support is contained in the compact image of tsupport(g) under y -> nullFourierProfilePoint y; use inverse coordinate identities. Then HasCompactSupport.toSchwartzMap constructs profile."
